@startuml seq_boot_session_timeout
title SC-BOOT-06 - Session timeout in the bootloader programming session

participant "UDS tester" as Tester
participant "Plant model" as Plant
box "TCU"
participant "Application" as App
participant "PBL" as PBL
participant "SBL" as SBL
end box

note over Tester, SBL
Covers: SYS-BOOT-009, SYS-BOOT-001, SYS-BOOT-002, SYS-BOOT-008, SIM-PLT-004
UDS requests on DIAG_PhysReq 0x7E1, responses on DIAG_Resp 0x7E9 (can_matrix section 5).
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
S3server = 5000 ms (reprogramming section 12).
end note

alt PBL programming session
  Tester -> PBL : last request (t0)
  PBL --> Tester : response
  note over Tester: the tester disappears
  ... no request for S3 = 5000 ms ...
  PBL -> PBL : t0 + 5000 ms: reset the MCU (SYS-BOOT-009)
else SBL programming session
  Tester -> SBL : last request (t0)
  SBL --> Tester : response
  note over Tester: the tester disappears
  ... no request for S3 = 5000 ms ...
  SBL -> SBL : t0 + 5000 ms: reset the MCU (SYS-BOOT-009)
end
note over PBL, SBL: reset: the SBL in RAM and the unlocked security state are discarded (SYS-BOOT-009 rationale)

alt application valid
  PBL -> PBL : application check valid (SYS-BOOT-001), 50 ms boot window without 10 02
  PBL -> App : start the application
  App -> Plant : TCU_Actuators, TCU_Status (control active <= 500 ms, SC-STA-01)
else application invalid (e.g. erased by the SBL before the timeout)
  PBL -> PBL : application check fails -> default session, no time limit (SYS-BOOT-002)
  note over PBL: no S3 reset in the default session; no TCU_Actuators / TCU_Status (SYS-BOOT-008)
  Plant -> Plant : hydraulic default (SIM-PLT-004)
end

note over Tester, SBL: 3E 80 every 2 s keeps the programming session alive (reprogramming section 2).
@enduml
